                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Common mistakes",
              "text": "No `plt.show()` in scripts; bars from unaggregated rows; pyplot and object APIs mixed on wrong axes; `savefig` after show."
            },
            {
              "type": "sidebox",
              "title": "Interview Point",
              "items": [
                "**Blank saved file?** savefig ran after show()",
                "**Leak in a plot loop?** `plt.close(fig)`",
                "**Bars of raw rows?** Aggregate with groupby first"
